n E213.a "pose error 2.55 -> 0.82 m (night failure half, 2 m); S night hold: none 0.640, unregistered 0.636, registered 0.651, exact 0.662; wrong map 0.598 -> 0.638 (trust 0.75)" "pose gate met, S gate (+0.015 over none) missed by 0.004, F1@1 +0.030 [+0.016, +0.049]; wrong-map gate met at 0.75"
n E213.b "best chain (B + gate) S night: none 0.651, unregistered 0.643, registered 0.664, exact 0.676; wrong with gate 0.647" "confirmed: about half of the gap to the exact map recovered, flat in the map error"
