n E222.b "path error at 20 m failure half, exact map: 0.28 / 0.27 / 0.28 m (no pruning), 0.28 / 0.27 / 0.27 (pruning), 0.28 / 0.27 / 0.26 (pruning + failure-trained head)" "no measurable planner-level effect (floor 0.27 m)"
n E230.f1p "TEST: S 0.748, Q 0.718, J 0.422, F1@1 0.839, lanes found 0.653, 15.6 vertices; route 0.841 / 0.844 (failure-trained 0.859 / 0.865)" "confirmed on TEST (loop-16 TEST champion S 0.728, J 0.260); written prediction S >= 0.75 missed (0.748), J >= 0.35 and route >= 0.80 met"
