n E231.a "j1 family on the failure series (failure half, VAL), j1rc - j1eq: spatial hold lanes found +0.052 / +0.058 / +0.071 (night / blur / three cameras off), Q +0.002 / -0.001 / -0.038 [-0.058, -0.020]; single frame lanes found +0.013 / +0.029 / +0.074, Q +0.016 / +0.022 / -0.015; j1eq - j1: Q +0.001 ... +0.011" "rule not met: lanes found >= +0.03 in all three types with the hold, but Q below the control by more than 0.005 for three cameras off; j1rc is not uniformly the robust choice, j1eq is the safer fast variant where cameras can drop out; prediction (Q >= +0.01) only for night / blur single frame"
