n E232.a0 "long joint fine-tune (4800 steps, builder loss weight 1), arm a (route loss reaches the builder), route seed 0: failure-half route success night 0.701 / blur 0.803 / three cameras off 0.569; graph S failure 0.623 / 0.627 / 0.580" "a - c -0.036 / -0.036 / 0.000: rule not met"
